Convert the core services to JSON logging.

Glance and Placement now honour openstack_logging_json, in the same
one line form as Keystone. Glance has two configuration files, the API
and the cache, and both need it or the cache logs would be the one
thing in the deployment the parser could not read.

No per service variable is added, for the reason given when Keystone
was converted: every oslo.log service is tailed by a single Fluentd
input with a single parser, so the format cannot vary between them.

Prompt: Michael asked for the bulk conversion to be broken into
batches by project rather than landing as thirty separate commits.
This is the first batch.

